rooms_desc ({"You are in front of bubbles house.You see flowers blooming everywhere.The house itself is made from white stone and looks great.","You are walking throug Bubbles entrace hall.It is big and yellow painted.You see the crystalic lamps over you and wonder howthey could get up there.","It is the workroom from Bubble.You see much magic stuff laying on a big black table.The pictures aon the wall all show somemagic symbols.This room ist a bit smaller than the entrace hall.You are feeling good here.","In this big eating room is Bubble eating every night and day.There is a big green table in the middle.There is a lovely silence laying over there.The room is well lighted and you can see flowers out of the windows.  Have a nice day.","This is a large floor with many many mirrors.You can see yourself in each of them.","This is a great dance hall...You can see musicers playing a slow melodie.This room is very big and all of you will fit in here.","The room is good lighted bacause the big windows.You see a bed in the right corner and a table in the left.In front of you, beside the window is a bookshelf.You can rest here if you want !","This is the kitchen.You can see many bottles and cooking stuff.Also there is a pizza oven in the right corner.All here smells good.","This is the bedroom of bubble.You can see a large bed standing in front of you.The room is a bit darker then the antrace hall.You think in the bed will also fit two persons.","This is the fun room.You see lots of dolls, mazes and puzzles here.A few books are standing in a bookshelf.Here you can play ...",})
rooms_short ({"You are in front of Bubbles house.","You are in the entrace hall of Bubbles house !","You are in Bubbles work room.","This is a big eating room.","This is a large floor with many mirrors.","This is a great dance hall.","This is the guest room.","This is the kitchen.","This si the bedroom of bubble","This is the fun room.",})
